1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:05,189
Small Business Relief didn't end in 2026.

2
00:00:05,309 --> 00:00:10,189
Small Business Relief now covers tax periods ending by when?

3
00:00:10,309 --> 00:00:14,747
2026, 2029, or no end date?

4
00:00:17,267 --> 00:00:24,950
31 December 2029. Extended in August 2026.

5
00:00:25,070 --> 00:00:29,378
Revenue AED 3 million or less this period.

6
00:00:29,498 --> 00:00:34,637
And in every earlier period since June 2023.

7
00:00:34,757 --> 00:00:38,077
It's elected in your corporate tax return.

8
00:00:38,197 --> 00:00:41,609
Our corporate tax advisory helps you check it.

9
00:00:41,729 --> 00:00:45,905
Electing it? Message us on WhatsApp.
